    {
      "bbox": [
        310,
        596,
        1235,
        810
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "## \u00a7 3. **Members.** The members of the Council shall include: the Deputy Mayor for Policy, the Commissioner of Health, the Commissioner of Mental Health and Mental Retardation Services, the Administrator of the Human Resources Administration and the Assistant to the Mayor for Health. The Health and Hospitals Corporation may designate a representative to participate on the Council. In addition, there shall be three members who are not employees of the City, at least one of whom shall be a physician, who shall be appointed by the Mayor for terms of one year and shall not serve for more than three consecutive terms. The ex-officio members of the Council shall have the power to exercise or delegate any functions, powers and duties vested in them by this Order.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
